### 4. Limitations / Issues

- **SPOF (Single Point of Failure)**  
  If this server goes down, the whole site is unavailable.

- **Downtime During Maintenance**  
  Restarting the server (e.g., after code deployment) will cause temporary downtime.

- **Scalability Limitations**  
  The single server can only handle limited traffic. Heavy loads could slow it down or crash it.

